1
00:00:00,385 --> 00:00:03,055
(quiet laugh)

2
00:00:03,055 --> 00:00:06,025
(Penny:)Wow, I just felt this wave

3
00:00:06,024 --> 00:00:09,664
(Penny:)of affection for you.

4
00:00:09,661 --> 00:00:13,161
(Sheldon:)You sure it's not
too much Bible juice?

5
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,830
(Penny:)And the wave is gone.

6
00:00:23,141 --> 00:00:24,411
(Zombie:)Brains!

7
00:00:24,409 --> 00:00:27,909
Keep it down!
We're working here.

8
00:00:27,913 --> 00:00:29,413
(Raj:)Okay, we've got
the cipher decoded!

9
00:00:29,414 --> 00:00:30,714
(Emily:)How's it going
with the globe?

10
00:00:30,716 --> 00:00:32,586
(Amy:)We used the coordinates
to locate the cities.

11
00:00:32,584 --> 00:00:34,114
(Leonard:)I'm putting the city names
in the grid now.

12
00:00:34,119 --> 00:00:35,949
(Leonard:)I'm sure that'll give us
the code to the safe.

13
00:00:35,954 --> 00:00:37,624
(Zombie:)Solve puzzle too fast!

14
00:00:37,622 --> 00:00:39,092
(Zombie:)Slow down!

15
00:00:39,991 --> 00:00:40,821
Yup! Got the code.

16
00:00:40,826 --> 00:00:42,426
(Baggage Clerk:)Just saying...

17
00:00:42,427 --> 00:00:45,497
(Zombie:)no refund for finish early!

18
00:00:49,401 --> 00:00:51,471
(Bernadette:)Sure you don't want to go home?

19
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:54,070
(Bernadette:)When the bag's returned,
they'll deliver it to us.

20
00:00:54,072 --> 00:00:57,072
(Howard:)No, I'm not leaving without her.

21
00:00:57,075 --> 00:01:02,025
(Bernadette:)All right, we'll wait.

